WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.970
LDS invaded You Show School, so we have 
to duel them with our school on the line.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:13.130
In the first duel of the best-of-three 
match, my opponent was Xyz Course's Hokuto Shijima.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:20.710
He was a strong duelist, but I managed 
to win for our first victory!

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:27.210
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:35.580
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.390
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.170
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.570
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.310
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:14.880
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:17.080
Impulse  Got it got it

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:22.290
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:33.050
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:39.970
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.910
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.310
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:57.590
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.930
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:10.980
Knight of the Secret Stone!  
Fusion User Masumi Koutsu

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.450
Yuya!

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.100
You made me shiver!

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.560
Yuya!

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.920
Yay!

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.140
Yuya!

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:26.270
Well done!

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:29.340
That's why you are the man 
Gongenzaka's best friend!

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.610
You moved me to tears!

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.300
Thanks...

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.630
Yuzu.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.700
What?

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.560
You're next.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:48.540
We're counting on you!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.870
Yes, leave it to me.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.650
Our You Show School is on the line.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.210
I must win!

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:04.010
I can't believe you lost against 
a student from this tiny school.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.570
You tarnished LDS Xyz Course's name.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:14.760
But now I want Pendulum Summon even more.

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.520
You're next.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.180
Yes, Chairwoman.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:27.420
I'm Fusion Course's Masumi Koutsu.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.790
So she's a Fusion user.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.630
Who will be my opponent?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.500
Me!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:53.340
To protect You Show School and clear 
Yuya's name, I can't lose this duel.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:54.590
But...

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:07.830
The appropriate field for 
my lovely daughter is...

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:08.900
This one!

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.590
Action Field on!

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:19.520
I activate the Field Spell Crystal Corridor!

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:32.850
Yuzu, I chose the perfect field to 
reflect your sparkling cuteness!

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:35.120
You'll shine here!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.810
Dad, you're embarrassing me.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:42.270
He must really love you if he thinks 
that you're actually shining.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.920
What did you say?

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:47.300
Your eyes are clouded.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.270
What's with that!

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.540
My papa is a jewel merchant.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:56.500
I've seen many jewels since I was a child.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:00.610
Real jewels that shine for real.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:07.320
That's why I know that you're not shining.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.790
It's proof that you're feeling perplexed.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:16.670
Enough with your nonsense!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:21.120
I'll prove whether I'm feeling 
perplexed or not in this duel!

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:25.170
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.990
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.980
...to move around the field!

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:33.110
Wit... ness

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:34.010
Wit... ness

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:34.940
...dueling's...

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.760
...greatest evolution!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.590
Action!

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:39.870
Duel!

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.540
I'll go first.

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:49.290
I activate the spell card 
Gem-Knight Fusion from my hand!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:54.760
This card lets me Fusion Summon using 
Gem-Knight monsters in my hand!

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.540
What?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.470
Fuse monsters that haven't been summoned yet?

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:04.500
She's using a spell card to 
fuse monsters in her hand.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.610
This is called Hand Fusion.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:11.850
I'm fusing Gem-Knight Tourmaline and 
Gem-Knight Emerald from my hand.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.320
The secret stone enveloped in lightning!

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.760
The glimmering green that brings luck!

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:21.160
The swirling light combines 
into a new brilliance!

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:24.810
Fusion Summon!

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:27.790
Appear, the seeker of victory!

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.560
Gem-Knight Topaz!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:34.810
She used Fusion Summon on her first turn?

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:40.760
Even your non-shining eyes can 
see Hand Fusion's magnificence.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.120
However...

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:47.650
The monster you Fusion Summoned 
only has 1800 attack points.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.960
I can defeat that monster.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.160
Don't underestimate it.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.140
How you deal with this monster 
will determine your fate.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:07:00.100
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.990
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:09.390
I activate the spell card 1st 
Movement Solo from my hand!

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:16.850
When I have no monsters, I can Special Summon a 
Level 4-or-below Melodious monster from my hand!

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.010
Now's your time!

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:22.920
I Special Summon Aria the Melodious Diva!

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:31.500
When there's a Melodious monster on the 
field, I can Special Summon this card from my hand.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:35.210
I Special Summon Sonata the Melodious Diva!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.940
The concert begins!

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:47.480
I tribute Aria and Sonata to Tribute Summon!

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:53.420
The enchanting melody that resounds to 
the heavens awakens the sleeping genius!

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:58.100
Come out, Level 8 Mozarta 
the Melodious Maestra!

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.460
A Level 8 appeared!

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:02.900
It's Yuzu's ace monster!

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.800
I'm not finished!

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:12.320
Once per turn, Mozarta can Special Summon a 
Level 4-or-below Melodious monster from my hand!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:16.210
Canon the Melodious Diva, take the stage!

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:22.270
Let's battle!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:26.360
Mozarta attacks Gem-Knight Topaz!

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:29.890
Graceful Wave!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.300
How's that?

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:40.030
That's how I deal with your monster!

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:47.520
Canon, you're up next!

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:51.070
Canon the Melodious Diva 
attacks you directly!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.670
She did it!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.520
It gives me shivers!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.670
Nice, Yuzu!

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:07.430
It seems you have some skill, 
but don't think that you've won.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:09.090
You just don't want to admit defeat!

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:13.340
You'll find out if that's true next turn.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:19.300
Canon the Melodious Diva can change 
battle position once per turn.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:23.740
I switch Canon the Melodious Diva 
to defense position and end my turn!

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:25.650
My turn!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.960
I summon Gem-Knight Alexandrite from my hand!

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:37.490
Gem-Knight Alexandrite's effect activates!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:42.460
By sending it to the graveyard, I can 
Special Summon one Gem-Knight from my deck!

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:45.210
I Special Summon Gem-Knight Crystal!

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:50.570
2450 attack points?

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:54.870
That's still less than 
Mozarta's attack points.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:59.640
I activate the trap card Fragment Fusion!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:06.820
By banishing Fusion Material Monsters from my 
graveyard, I can Fusion Summon one Gem-Knight!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:11.060
Fusion Summon using 
monsters in the graveyard?

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:16.740
I banish Gem-Knight Alexandrite, Tourmaline 
and Emerald from my graveyard.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:25.440
She's fusing Alexandrite with Gem-Knight 
Topaz's two Fusion Material Monsters.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:29.140
She seems to have some skill.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:32.190
The magical stone that's both day and night!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.310
The secret stone enveloped in lightning!

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:36.950
The glimmering green that brings luck!

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:41.430
The swirling light combines 
into a new brilliance!

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.280
Fusion Summon!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.590
Appear!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:49.330
The supreme brilliance that 
illuminates everything!

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.910
Gem-Knight Master Diamond!

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:58.140
This is my ace monster.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:06.270
I'll use Gem-Knight Master Diamond's power 
to banish Gem-Knight Topaz from the graveyard.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.070
Banish?  Why?

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:10.220
Yuzu!

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:11.940
Don't let your guard down!

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.150
She's planning something.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.660
You must be really confident 
if you're looking away.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:24.560
Let's battle!

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:29.840
First, Gem-Knight Crystal attacks Canon 
the Melodious Diva in defense position!

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:35.390
Time for the main event!

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:39.290
Gem-Knight Master Diamond attacks Mozarta!

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:48.540
Yuzu's ace monster was destroyed!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.690
But she only took 300 points of damage.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:52.410
Incorrect.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:53.730
What do you mean?

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:59.990
I activated Gem-Knight Master 
Diamond's effect before the battle.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:08.890
It can use the effects of a Level 7-or-below Gem-Knight 
Fusion Monster that was banished from the graveyard this turn.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:13.090
That's why you banished Gem-Knight Topaz?

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:16.390
Exactly.  Here's Topaz's first effect!

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:23.390
You take damage equal to the original attack 
points of the monster that was destroyed in battle!

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:31.840
Yuzu!  Get fired up!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.790
Let your blood boil!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:36.140
2600 points of big damage.

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:38.690
But she still has life points left.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:39.790
Yuzu can pull this out-

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.190
No, she can't.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.240
This is the end.

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:49.040
Topaz's second effect.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:52.390
It can attack twice in one battle!

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:53.640
What?

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.340
That means Yuzu will be...

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:56.940
...defeated.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:59.790
That's why I said it was over.

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:03.790
It's no good.  At this rate...

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.740
I...

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:09.640
This will finish you!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.770
An Action Card!

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.940
Due to Topaz's effect...

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.190
It's all or nothing.

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.640
Gem-Knight Master Diamond 
attacks you directly!

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.540
I got it!

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.520
No way...

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.340
You were fooled by a fake 
image in the crystal.

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:38.460
Your eyes must be very cloudy.

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:02.760
Aww, she really lost.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:04.790
As expected.

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.840
Yuzu...

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:09.760
Yuzu!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.790
Are you hurt?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.840
No.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:17.490
That's good-

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:22.640
Hey, are you okay?

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:25.390
What was I doing?

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.540
Yuya is right here.

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:29.620
He really is here.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:37.220
But I didn't believe his words, 
so I was worrying all by myself.

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:41.690
Like she said, I was fooled by a fake.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:44.960
You two are giving me quite a show.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.400
Ouch!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.040
Why did you do that?

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.690
Sorry!

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:57.940
Instead of apologizing, don't 
push me in the first place.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:03.320
It was an important duel, but I...

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.390
Don't worry about it.

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:07.240
We just have to win the next one.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.590
Yuya...

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.490
Just win the next one?

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.990
You say that so casually.

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:17.390
Who are you?

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:21.740
I'm LDS Synchro Course's Yaiba Toudou.

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:24.340
Which one of you is my opponent?

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.390
Yuya won.

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:32.190
And Yuzu lost.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:33.990
So it's one win, one loss.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:40.520
The man Gongenzaka would like 
to get revenge for Yuzu.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:46.190
You Show School is on the line, but I'm an 
outsider because I'm Gongenzaka Dojo's successor.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:47.690
Sora, listen!

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:49.240
This is a do-or-die situation!

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.930
You must win!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:55.190
I don't like this uncomfortable situation.

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:58.940
You can have the next duel if you want, Gon.

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.590
Gon?

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:03.080
I'm allowed to duel?

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:09.190
Yeah.  I don't feel like facing him.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:13.440
In that case...

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:15.990
We're counting on you, Gongenzaka.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:21.340
Since you're my best friend, I feel 
comfortable entrusting you with this match.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.440
Yuya...

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.540
All right!  Leave it to me!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:32.090
I promise to win in the name of 
Gongenzaka Dojo's Immovable Duel style!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:32.990
Hey!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.190
How long are you going to keep me waiting?

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:38.190
Or are you going to forfeit 
out of fear?  Well?

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:44.120
How inexcusable to treat the 
man Gongenzaka as a coward!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:50.090
I'm your opponent!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:56.940
If you think I'm well-mannered like the 
other two, you'll be in a world of hurt.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:03.940
Because unlike them, I'm very strong.

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:09.590
How dare Yaiba say that we're weak!

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:13.980
It's annoying, but you can't 
do anything because you lost.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:23.790
The opponent is Yaiba Toudou.  
"Yaiba" means "blade" or "sword."

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:25.690
I choose this!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.190
Action Field on!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.490
The Field Spell Sword Cemetery!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:46.940
Gongenzaka, bury Yaiba 
in this Sword Cemetery!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:55.140
Mr. Hiiragi, if we win this duel, You Show 
School and Yuya Sakaki will both belong to LDS.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:57.490
That's fine, correct?

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:03.140
But if we win, you'll never 
meddle with Yuya again.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:13.390
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:16.140
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.740
...to move around the field!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.240
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.850
Action!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:25.090
Duel!

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:28.940
I'll go first.

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:32.830
I summon Superheavy Samurai 
Kabuto from my hand!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.890
I end my turn.

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:48.040
All you did was summon a weak 
monster with 1000 attack points.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.740
A truly strong man doesn't 
make unnecessary movements.

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.690
Whatever, you blockhead!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:57.190
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:03.590
I summon XX-Saber Boggart 
Knight from my hand!

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:15.500
When this monster is summoned, I can Special 
Summon one Level 4-or-below X-Saber from my hand.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:22.090
I Special Summon the Level 3 Tuner Monster 
XX-Saber Fulhelmknight from my hand!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.880
Tuner Monster?

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:28.840
Superheavy Samurai Kabuto's effect activates!

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:32.990
When you Special Summon a monster, this 
monster switches to defense position!

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:37.060
And it gains 500 defense 
points during this turn!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:39.440
Too bad.

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:43.530
If you didn't Special Summon, 
you could have defeated Kabuto.

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:47.390
The one who makes unnecessary 
moves will lose this duel.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.140
Remember that.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:50.690
Nice, Gongenzaka!

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:53.390
Show him your Immovable Duel style!

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:56.090
Immovable Duel?  Whatever!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.860
I'll keep going!

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:06.250
When there are two or more X-Sabers on my 
field, I can Special Summon XX-Saber Faultroll!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.990
He already has three monsters!

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.540
Incredible!

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.800
You should be surprised after you see this!

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:21.900
Level 3 Fulhelmknight tunes 
Level 4 Boggart Knight!

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:28.590
Wield your crossed swords and step 
over the mountain of corpses!

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.690
Synchro Summon!

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:39.540
Come out, Level 7 X-Saber Souza!

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:43.240
What's this?

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:53.190
A Tuner Monster tunes other monsters to bring out a powerful monster 
from the Extra Deck whose Level equals the total Level of the monsters.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.870
This is Synchro Summoning.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:21:01.840
So he added Level 3 plus 4 
to summon a Level 7 monster!

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:05.390
That's right!  And I'm not done!

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:12.620
Once per turn, XX-Saber Faultroll can Special 
Summon a Level 4-or-below X-Saber from the graveyard.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:18.590
I'm bringing out XX-Saber Fulhelmknight.

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:25.090
He used an effect to resurrect the Tuner he 
used to Synchro Summon from the graveyard?

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:27.540
Can this be...

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:29.870
It can be, missy!

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:34.340
Level 3 Fulhelmknight 
tunes Level 6 Faultroll!

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:36.690
Shine your silver armor!

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:39.340
Crush the hopes of the opposition!

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:41.890
Synchro Summon!

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:46.450
Come out, Level 9 XX-Saber Gottoms!

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:51.290
He's unbelievable!

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:56.190
He Synchro Summoned twice in just one turn.

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:18.980
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:28.460
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.350 --> 00:22:40.470
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:45.700
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:51.140
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:56.410
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.600 --> 00:23:02.000
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:06.450
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:12.390
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:17.800
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:23.130
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:32.470
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:40.690
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.840 --> 00:23:50.940
Shine your silver armor!  Crush 
the hopes of the opposition!

00:23:50.940 --> 00:23:54.740
Synchro Summon!  XX-Saber Gottoms!

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:57.650
He Synchro Summoned again!

00:23:57.650 --> 00:23:59.990
It isn't fair that he's the 
only one summoning monsters!

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:05.040
I've gathered the two most 
powerful X-Sabers!  Look at them!

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:11.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Body and Sword as One!!  Synchro User Yaiba Toudou

00:24:11.430 --> 00:24:14.140
The fun is only getting started!
